  data: {
    LLM: 'Identify the trump suit quickly and secure your 5ndpoint cards (all 5s regardless of suit) as soon as your team wins a trick.\n\nSince 16 cards are missing, do not assume high trumps like the King or Queen are in play. If you hold the Jack, it might be the highest trump.\n\nBidding/Pitching Strategy: Pitch a suit where you hold a 5 to secure immediate points, or pitch a suit where you have a void to allow your partner to trump in.',
